NAME

    Text::EditDistance::DamerauLevenshtein - Damerau-Levenshtein edit
    distance

INSTALLATION

    To install this module, run the following commands:

        perl Makefile.PL
        make
        make test
        make install

SUPPORT AND DOCUMENTATION

    After installing, you can find documentation for this module with the
    perldoc command.

        perldoc Text::EditDistance::DamerauLevenshtein

    You can also look for information at:

    *   MetaCPAN:
        <https://metacpan.org/pod/Text::EditDistance::DamerauLevenshtein>

    *   The source repository on Codeberg:
        <https://codeberg.org/mauke/Text-EditDistance-DamerauLevenshtein>

    *   The module's bug tracker:
        <https://codeberg.org/mauke/Text-EditDistance-DamerauLevenshtein/iss
        ues>

